 ```
 
-### Compensation & tenure
-
-```DAX
-Avg Monthly Income   = AVERAGE( FactEmployee[MonthlyIncome] )
-Median Income        = MEDIAN(  FactEmployee[MonthlyIncome] )
-Avg Tenure (Years)   = AVERAGE( FactEmployee[YearsAtCompany] )
